From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 18:55:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bedrock): request live skin changes

Send a PlayerSkin update for classic skins and converted account characters while connected to a Bedrock world. Use the local actor UUID from the Bedrock player list, and keep the next-join appearance if a live update cannot be attempted. A matching server skin packet confirms the echo, but a second client is still needed to verify what others see.
